msgid "of which consumers"
msgstr "di cui consumatori"

#: src/Modules/Tax/Admin/OssMonitorSection.php:102
msgid "of which business customers taxed by EuroB2B (no confirmed VAT ID of another member state, exemption off or another reason)"
msgstr "di cui clienti business tassati da EuroB2B (nessuna partita IVA confermata di un altro Stato membro, esenzione disattivata o altro motivo)"

#: src/Modules/Tax/Admin/OssMonitorSection.php:103
msgid "of which orders without a EuroB2B tax treatment (older orders)"
msgstr "di cui ordini senza trattamento fiscale EuroB2B (ordini meno recenti)"

#: src/Modules/Tax/Admin/OssMonitorSection.php:104
msgid "of which Northern Ireland (code XI, or GB with a BT postcode)"
msgstr "di cui Irlanda del Nord (codice XI o GB con codice postale BT)"

#: src/Modules/Tax/Admin/OssMonitorSection.php:105
