#: src/Modules/Tax/TaxModule.php:330
msgid "Intra-Community exemption"
msgstr "Esenzione intracomunitaria"

#: src/Modules/Tax/TaxModule.php:331
msgid "Exempt business customers in other EU member states from VAT when all conditions hold (valid VAT ID from another member state, delivery or establishment outside the shop country, no self-collection)"
